💭 The program behind tests/numbers.sh: reads every literal in build/numbers/reads.txt and
💭 writes every real in build/numbers/writes.txt, and compares each with what Python made of
💭 it, bit for bit. A real is given as a whole number times a power of two, which doubling
💭 and halving build exactly.
